flowchart TD
    A[User request in Agent mode] --> B{Intent}
    B -->|Run tests| C[playwright-test-runner all]
    B -->|Investigate failures| D{Source repo path provided?}
    D -->|No| E[Stop and ask for source path]
    D -->|Yes| F[playwright-rca]
    F --> G[Create ai-reports session artifacts]
    G --> H[Classify each failure]
    H --> I{recommendedAction}
    I -->|auto-fix| J[playwright-fixer test/page-object changes]
    I -->|inspect-source| K[Inspect app source and propose fix]
    K --> L{User approves source changes?}
    L -->|No| M[Record suggested fix only]
    L -->|Yes| N[Apply source plus test updates]
    J --> O[playwright-test-runner failed rerun]
    N --> O
    M --> O
    O --> P[Update diagnosis and fixer report]
    P --> Q{Need HTML report?}
    Q -->|Yes| R[generate-rca-report]
    Q -->|No| S[Finish]
    R --> S
